---
/**
 * Required licence notice for every page built on ScrapedDuck data.
 *
 * ScrapedDuck mirrors leekduck.com and allows reuse only with visible credit to
 * both projects on a page that is neither paywalled nor ad-supported. This
 * component is the single place that promise is kept — render it on any page
 * that shows raids, eggs, research, or events.
 */
import './game.css';
import { LEEKDUCK_URL, SCRAPEDDUCK_URL } from '~/lib/scrapedduck';
---

<aside class="g-attribution">
  <p>
    Live game data comes from <a href={LEEKDUCK_URL} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"
      >Leek Duck</a
    > and is mirrored for us by <a href={SCRAPEDDUCK_URL} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"
      >ScrapedDuck</a
    >. Pokémon artwork and type icons are served from Leek Duck's own CDN. Please support them —
    they do the daily work of keeping this current, and we simply read it.
  </p>
  <p>
    PoGo TXK is a free community site: no ads, no paywall, no tracking on this page. Raid tiers,
    egg pools, and research tasks rotate frequently, so check Leek Duck if something here looks
    out of date.
  </p>
</aside>
